  "scope": "Static reads of external licensed images and disclosed tracked native-save fixtures. P04 is a native-saved derivative of a generated tree prediction and is used solely as a reader fixture. No native process ran. No held-out credit, new output or acceptance is claimed.",
  "method": [
    "Check SHA-256 and length of the external executable and studied modules against Manifest2026.json.",
    "Read 1,000 big-endian u32 IDs at 0x582ed0 and 1,000 three-word signature rows at 0x583e70. Reverse bytes in each signature word to file order. Compare all four fields and index against the recorded 2025 research inventory.",
    "Open the tracked fixture bytes only with SldprtArchive.from_bytes after comparing the committed fixture digest with the public corpus manifest. Read local, central and end signatures for comparison with that fixture's exact file ID row.",
    "Read the container version, stream name version markers, Features XML swVersion when present, and KeyWords framing tuple. Tuple positions are XML marker present, BOM present, CRLF count and bare LF count.",
    "For typed cases, observe the original Schema.P.load and Schema.Cnt.load calls with cursor before and after, active Registry.run_load schema, enclosing object class and value. Correlate observed count values with the actual decoded collection lengths.",
    "Load CMgr from rooted base 1. Load Config-0 with the typed ModelHeader direct identities and pass its actual final map to load_resolved_compat. Record each stream's undecoded tail length and the resolved prefix."
  ],
